  "title": "Increase decimal scale at fixed precision",
  "category": "numeric",
  "description": "A decimal128(9, 2) column becomes decimal128(9, 4). Precision is unchanged, so the largest representable magnitude shrinks from 9999999.99 to 99999.9999. Every v0 value still fits and every value is numerically unchanged (1.20 and 1.2000 are the same number).",
